WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.023
Welcome to the Theme Park District.

2
00:00:02.023 --> 00:00:04.720
Great businesses are powered by a strong team.

3
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:12.474
But hiring in the U.S. comes with rules that often surprise international founders, and mistakes here can be expensive and hard to resolve.

4
00:00:12.474 --> 00:00:21.914
In this module, you'll learn: The difference between an employee and a contractor, and how the IRS evaluates the actual working relationship, not just what your contract says.

5
00:00:21.914 --> 00:00:27.309
Common U.S. visa categories, and why forming a company does not automatically give you work authorization.

6
00:00:27.309 --> 00:00:33.714
The true cost of hiring in the U.S., salary plus roughly 15 to 30 percent in additional employment costs.

7
00:00:33.714 --> 00:00:36.411
Spend some time with the hiring cost calculator.

8
00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:39.446
It will save you from underestimating your first payroll.

9
00:00:39.446 --> 00:00:40.120
Let's begin.
